=EMP=
*  Cost: %Minerals%100
*  [[concepts/initiative|Initiative]]: 30
*  [[concepts/vehicle|Weight]]: 5
*  Base [[concepts/scanning range]]: 3
*  Offensive turret
*  [[concepts/attack range|Base horizontal attack range]]: 17 (Artillery)
*  Consumes %Uranium%50 per shot
